                1. TECHNICAL  — moving-average and oscillator rating, daily and weekly, with a timestamp
                2. ANALYST    — sell-side consensus, the analyst count and the target price

              They are captured and stored separately and are never collapsed
              into one "market view".

              Where a security has no analyst coverage the record says

              "No analyst consensus available" — the technical rating is NEVER
              used to infer it (§16, §30).
